     - SSRS = \(\sum_{i=1}^{n} (x_i - \bar{x}_i)^2\)  
     - SSRS'' = \(\sum_{i=1}^{n} (x_i - \bar{X})^2\)  

5. **Interpret the Results**:  
   - The results of the ANOVA analysis will include a confidence statistic (e.g., \(p\)-value).  
   - If the confidence statistic is less than the pre-defined threshold (e.g., 0.05), the ANOVA results indicate that there is a significant difference in the mean height of wheat plants between the four groups.  
