\[
\Delta S = [2 \times 66.5] + [2 \times 248.2] - [2 \times 91.2] - [3 \times 205.1]
\]

\[
\Delta S = 133 + 496.4 - 182.4 - 615.3
\]

\[
\Delta S = 629.4 - 797.7 = -168.3 \text{ J/mol K}
\]

Thus, the entropy change for the reaction is \(\boxed{-168.3 \text{ J/mol K}}\).
