\end{cases*}
\]
Subtracting equation (2) from equation (1), we get:
\[
(x + ky + 3z) - (x + ky - 2z) = 0 \implies 5z = 0 \implies z = 0.
\]
Substituting \( z = 0 \) into the system, we get:
\[
