B = (4π × 10⁻⁷ Tm/A * 100 * 1 A) / (2 * 0.2 m)

B = (4π × 10⁻⁵ Tm) / 0.4 m

B ≈ (1.2566 × 10⁻⁴ T) / 0.4 m

B ≈ 3.1415 × 10⁻⁴ T

